    "narrative": "For today\u2019s slate, **Gunnar Henderson** (76.16) and **Jacob Wilson** (74.08) stand out as our clear offensive anchors. **Gunnar Henderson** benefits from a high-upside matchup against Freddy Peralta; specifically, Peralta\u2019s slow delivery offers a prime opportunity for **Gunnar Henderson** to capitalize on his elite sprint speed, adding a 2% boost to his efficiency score in a category where we desperately need to stay competitive. Similarly, **Jacob Wilson** benefits from a high-park-factor environment and an advantageous matchup against a weaker arm in Bradford (5.29 xERA). **Jackson Merrill** (69.57) rounds out our top-tier starts, utilizing a strong platoon advantage against Bibee to maintain a high ceiling despite the opponent\u2019s solid underlying metrics.\n\nWe are forced to navigate several difficult matchups, including facing elite arms like Cease and Henderson. **Luis Garc\u00eda Jr.** (56.52) remains a reliable start despite facing Cease, bolstered by a significant 14% dynamic platoon edge. Conversely, we\u2019ve opted to bench **Coby Mayo** (43.08) and **Wade Meckler** (42.57). **Coby Mayo** was the closest to making the cut, but his lower spot in the batting order and diminished platoon advantage against a tough right-handed arm ultimately dropped him just below the threshold of our higher-scoring utility options. **Luis Lara** falls strictly into the \"below floor\" category today, as the matchup against Tarik Skubal makes him an easy scratch to preserve our game caps.\n\nRisks remain prevalent, particularly with the trio of **Andy Pages**, **Heliot Ramos**, and **Kyle Tucker**, all of whom are facing challenging starters with sub-3.00 xERAs. While **Kyle Tucker** carries a respectable 51.47 score, his output is suppressed by the matchup against the Henderson-led rotation; we are counting on his high base-projection stability to weather the SP-skill deficit. Monitor **Drake Baldwin** closely in the leadoff spot; his 54.77 score is solid, but if official lineup reports suggest any fatigue or adjustments in the batting order, his value could fluctuate rapidly given the tight margins on our roster.",
